---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import FlowDiagram from "../components/FlowDiagram.astro";
import ExperienceJourney from "../components/ExperienceJourney.astro";
---
<Layout title="Ken Lim — Data & AI, end to end" description="Ken Lim builds the end-to-end data-to-AI stack — ingestion pipelines, governed data platforms, trained and tuned models, to shipped data and AI products. 18+ years across fintech, healthtech, proptech and the public sector.">

  <!-- letterhead / hero -->
  <section class="relative pt-16 pb-12 sm:pt-24">
    <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-stone-400">Ken Lim — Vienna · New York</p>
    <h1 class="mt-5 font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 sm:text-5xl">
      Data &amp; AI,<br />end to end<span class="text-stone-300">.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-7 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300">
      I build the entire path from raw data to shipped AI and data products — pipelines,
      governed platforms, trained and tuned models, and services running in production.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-6 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-stone-400">18+ years · 7 companies · 3 acquisitions · U.S. citizen</p>
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-start gap-x-6 gap-y-2 font-mono text-[12px]">
      <a class="text-[#03aa5c] hover:underline dark:text-[#3cc287]" href="mailto:mail@kennylim.com">mail@kennylim.com</a>
      <a class="text-stone-500 hover:text-[#03aa5c] dark:text-stone-400 dark:hover:text-stone-100" href="tel:+19298889061">+1 (929) 888-9061</a>
      <a class="text-stone-500 hover:text-[#03aa5c] dark:text-stone-400 dark:hover:text-stone-100" href="https://linkedin.com/in/kenny-lim" rel="noopener" target="_blank">LinkedIn ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 1. about me -->
  <section data-reveal class="border-t border-stone-200/80 py-12 dark:border-stone-800">
    <p class="font-displaymono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-stone-400">01 — who I am</p>
    <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">About me</h2>
    <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300">
      <p>
        Most AI initiatives don't fail at the model — they fail at the data. The trouble hides
        in the seams between layers, so I work the full stack myself: ingesting raw data,
        pipelines and transformation, governed platforms, the ML layer, and the AI services on
        top — agents, RAG, MCP. Being hands-on in every layer is how I find the seams before
        they split.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm a hands-on data tech lead, and that keeps me on the front line, close to reality.
        I set strategy, design the architecture, write production code, and grow the people
        around me — coaching in-house teams, leading onshore and offshore contractors. The
        elbow grease still goes in: complex, messy data doesn't become clean, governed tables
        without tenacity and grit. And I run what I build — monitoring, scaling, tuning — so I
        know exactly how it behaves in production.
      </p>
      <p>
        It's been an 18+ year run — fintech, healthtech, consumer and enterprise SaaS, proptech,
        the public sector, three acquisitions along the way. It began with a decade of
        consulting: big-data builds on modern stacks for clients in finance, government,
        health, retail and utilities around the world. That work made me pragmatic,
        results-driven, cost-conscious and transparent — and taught me what success actually
        looks like: the client still running the platform years later, using it every day,
        getting what it was built for — long after the consultant leaves.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2. what I do -->
  <section id="do" data-reveal class="scroll-mt-6 border-t border-stone-200/80 py-12 dark:border-stone-800">
    <p class="font-displaymono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-stone-400">02 — the work</p>
    <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">What I do</h2>
    <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300">
      The five stages below — what each one produces.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-9">
      <FlowDiagram />
    </div>
    <p class="mt-8 font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">
      Where I've done it → <a class="text-[#03aa5c] hover:underline dark:text-[#3cc287]" href="/experience">Experience</a>
    </p>
  </section>

</Layout>
